Z||000043||BellaFiero||09-14-2000||11:02 AM||||Sex in a Fiero is totally awesome. And very possible. A little weird, but you don’t really care at the point you decide you’re going to get lucky in a car, you know? Pop your sunroof out, and sit on the console. Have her sit in your lap. Might want to press a shirt against your backs to stop from hitting the edges of the sunroof opening. Have her grab the sides of the opening and lower and raise herself... you get the general idea. Sex on a fiero is NOT a good idea. I totally dented The hood of my friend’s 84 Fiero. Not a good thing. I had to get him a new one … of course, it was worth it and all, but still. He had let me borrow his ride that night to see how a manual Fiero drove, and that damn manual transmission got in the way all the time.. so we moved outside. While interesting, I will say this - best idea is to foreplay until you get home, and then take it to your bedroom. Much more romantic, soft... and not to mention safe.<P>||||reg||1
